th a comfortable bed, a large wardrobe, and a desk, providing ample space for both relaxation and productivity. Our shared apartments are the perfect opportunity for “newcomers” to Munich to quickly find their footing and build meaningful connections. Here, you’ll find not just a place to stay, but also a welcoming and vibrant community to be part of. Thanks to the relaxed and friendly atmosphere in our shared flats, settling in feels effortless. In our experience, everyone quickly finds their place—whether you’re new to the city or simply looking for a fresh start. We, as landlords, highly value respectful and considerate interactions among roommates—because a harmonious living environment is what truly makes shared living enjoyable!\n\nCommon Areas\nThe apartment was recently renovated and shines with a modern and fresh design. It features a stylish bathroom with high-quality, contemporary tiles that create a welcoming atmosphere. The built-in kitchen is fully equipped with everything needed for cooking and dining: a refrigerator, freezer, stovetop, oven, sink, dishwasher, and washing machine. Many of our shared apartments even include washing machines with an integrated dryer function, adding extra convenience. There is also a comfortable dining area with seating for shared meals and socializing. The high-quality flooring throughout the apartment enhances the modern ambiance and provides a comfortable living environment. Wi-Fi is, of course, available – either provided by the landlord and included in the monthly utility costs or organized among the flatmates, with minimal shared costs. This combination of comfort, style, and modern amenities makes living in this apartment particularly enjoyable and ensures a smooth daily routine.\n\nNeighborhood\nThe apartment is located in a peaceful area of Munich. The neighborhood offers excellent public transportation options, making it easy to explore the city and access various local amenities. It combines a tranquil residential environment with close proximity to Munich’s vibrant cultural and social scenes, making it an ideal choice for both students and professionals seeking comfort and convenience.\n\nPlease note: The keys can only be handed over and you can only move in if the deposit and the admin fee have been demonstrably transferred to the provider before the move-in date.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"no"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"shared_w_both"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomSize":{"value":"14"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"no"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"other"},"garden":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"housematesGender":{"value":"shared_w_both"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"shared"},"kitchenware":{"value":"no"},"livingRoom":{"value":"no"},"parking":{"value":"no"},"pets":{"value":"no"},"playMusic":{"value":"discussable"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"no"},"smoking":{"value":"outside_only"},"toilet":{"value":"shared"},"totalSize":{"value":"70"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"no"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":80000,"deposit":150000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"800.00","deposit":"1500.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":6,"moveInWindow":14,"currentOccupancy":3,"minAge":18,"maxAge":35,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2026-05-01"}],"updated":"2026-04-15T10:47:01Z","__utId__":"ut1688747"}]